# NAVIS_BACKEND_DEMO_AUTH — optional local account demo route opt-in.
# VITE_NAVIS_DATA_SOURCE — optional source for the static frontend build.

# Compose sets these runtime settings.
# NAVIS_DB_HOST — local PostgreSQL hostname.
# NAVIS_ACCOUNT_URL — private account HTTP origin.
# NAVIS_INVENTORY_URL — private inventory HTTP origin.
# NAVIS_ACCOUNT_SIGNING_KEY_FILE — account ES256 private key file.
# NAVIS_GATEWAY_ACCOUNT_TOKEN_FILE — gateway-to-account token file.
# NAVIS_GATEWAY_INVENTORY_TOKEN_FILE — gateway-to-inventory token file.
# NAVIS_POS_URL — private POS HTTP origin.
# NAVIS_POS_FIXTURE_NOW — fixed synthetic POS clock for the local authenticated fixture routes.
# NAVIS_GATEWAY_POS_TOKEN_FILE — gateway-to-POS token file. Set on POS to enable the owner fixture routes.
# NAVIS_GATEWAY_CUSTOMER_TOKEN_FILE — gateway-to-customer token file for owner fixture routes.
# NAVIS_CUSTOMER_POS_TOKEN_FILE — customer-to-POS token file. Set on POS to enable the claim fixture routes.
# NAVIS_REDIS_URL — private Redis origin without credentials. Workloads read named Redis credential files.
